WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:46.250
In the previous verses of Chapter 14,

2
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.541
Lord Krishna described

3
00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:53.333
the inner perspective of a seeker who
has risen above the three gunas –

4
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:56.500
sattva, rajas, and tamas.

5
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.708
Now in these two verses He explains

6
00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:03.625
how such a seeker behaves outwardly.

7
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:05.458
He also makes clear

8
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:07.416
how people can recognise such a person

9
00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:09.666
through their conduct.

10
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.583
Lord Krishna explains –

11
00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:19.750
the seeker who has risen above
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

12
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.083
all three gunas –

13
00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.416
has a mind that remains equally poised

14
00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.500
in joy and sorrow.

15
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.083
For them,

16
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:31.416
gold, stone, and earth hold equal value.

17
00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:34.333
Criticism or praise, honour or dishonour,

18
00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:35.750
friend or enemy –

19
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.291
nothing disturbs them.

20
00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:42.208
This is not because they have
become insensitive.

21
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.500
It is because

22
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.208
they are firmly established

23
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:47.583
in their true inner nature.

24
00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:51.000
They no longer measure their worth
by the world’s opinion

25
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.625
or its gifts.

26
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:58.208
They have found a deep spiritual
identity within –

27
00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:01.166
one that does not change with circumstances.

28
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.125
For this reason they free themselves

29
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:07.000
from unnecessary material activities.

30
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.208
They work neither to impress others

31
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:13.958
nor to prove themselves.

32
00:02:13.958 --> 00:02:15.750
This is not inaction –

33
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.208
it is inner clarity.

34
00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:21.333
Their actions are not for the ego,

35
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.958
but for Lord Krishna.

36
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:25.083
Their peace

37
00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:28.375
does not come from running away from life,

38
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:31.625
but from seeing life clearly.

39
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:35.416
They know this world is temporary.

40
00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:38.291
So they move through it with ease –

41
00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.083
clinging to nothing,

42
00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:42.125
pushing nothing away.

43
00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:43.916
Neither excessive joy in happiness

44
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.750
nor excessive despair in sorrow.

45
00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:49.708
When the feeling is balanced, the seeker moves

46
00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:52.375
swiftly on the path of liberation.

47
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:53.666
Reflect on this.

48
00:02:58.583 --> 00:02:59.791
Think a little

49
00:02:59.791 --> 00:03:02.333
about your life…

50
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:06.333
Many of your thoughts and actions

51
00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:08.625
are inwardly linked to the desire

52
00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:11.625
for recognition.

53
00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.208
You want

54
00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:16.333
someone to notice your efforts.

55
00:03:16.333 --> 00:03:17.666
You hope

56
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:21.250
your success will be appreciated.

57
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:25.916
And if that does not happen, the mind

58
00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:28.666
becomes dejected.

59
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:31.625
But I ask you –

60
00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:32.583
how long

61
00:03:32.583 --> 00:03:37.291
will you measure your worth
on the world’s scales?

62
00:03:37.291 --> 00:03:40.416
As long as your happiness depends
only on praise

63
00:03:40.416 --> 00:03:44.041
and peace comes only from avoiding criticism,

64
00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:47.083
you will remain bound by the world’s

65
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:49.875
ever-changing opinions.

66
00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:52.958
But when you understand

67
00:03:52.958 --> 00:03:57.666
that your true worth comes from within –

68
00:03:57.666 --> 00:04:02.625
from your eternal relationship with Me –

69
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:05.708
the mind becomes light.

70
00:04:05.708 --> 00:04:07.541
You begin to walk freely

71
00:04:07.541 --> 00:04:10.458
with a steady intellect.

72
00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:13.208
You must have noticed –

73
00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:16.500
whatever you do,

74
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.208
however you dress, however

75
00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:22.541
you behave – some will find it very good,

76
00:04:22.541 --> 00:04:26.958
some will not at all, and some will
find it ordinary.

77
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:30.125
The world is full of all kinds of people.

78
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:32.875
The effort to satisfy everyone

79
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:36.791
ultimately gives only dissatisfaction.

80
00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:40.000
So whatever you do,

81
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.583
whatever action you take, do it
with sincerity and integrity,

82
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.125
aimed toward Me –

83
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:52.125
that alone will give you contentment
and liberation.

84
00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:55.291
Do not stop doing good deeds.

85
00:04:55.291 --> 00:04:58.000
But do them because

86
00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.958
they are right –

87
00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:03.375
not because someone is watching.

88
00:05:03.375 --> 00:05:07.083
When you find joy in fulfilling duty itself, 

89
00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:09.708
without expecting applause –

90
00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:14.166
you truly rise above the gunas.

91
00:05:14.166 --> 00:05:16.750
This is true strength.

92
00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.916
This is true freedom.

93
00:05:19.916 --> 00:05:24.000
Keep your direction toward Me –

94
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.708
not toward the noise of the world.

95
00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:28.083
Reflect on this.

96
00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:35.791
Think – how does this show up

97
00:05:35.791 --> 00:05:39.458
in family life…

98
00:05:39.458 --> 00:05:41.583
Inside the home,

99
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:45.458
there is often a silent pressure –

100
00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:48.583
look good, impress everyone,

101
00:05:48.583 --> 00:05:52.208
rise in everyone’s eyes.

102
00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:53.541
And without realising it,

103
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:55.041
we pass this pressure

104
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:57.625
on to our children.

105
00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.208
We tell them –

106
00:05:59.208 --> 00:06:03.333
behave well so people are impressed.

107
00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:07.000
Be polite so relatives are pleased.

108
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.416
Be successful so the world applauds.

109
00:06:10.416 --> 00:06:12.291
But think –

110
00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:15.458
are you preparing your children

111
00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:19.291
only to receive praise,

112
00:06:19.291 --> 00:06:24.000
or to be rooted in truth and stability?

113
00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.416
A person who

114
00:06:25.416 --> 00:06:27.166
grows up depending

115
00:06:27.166 --> 00:06:29.666
on others’ approval

116
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:33.000
always lives on the mercy of others.

117
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.416
But one who is grounded in truth,

118
00:06:36.416 --> 00:06:39.750
purpose, and inner strength

119
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.833
can walk any path –

120
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:46.708
even when no one is watching.

121
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:50.333
So teach your children that they

122
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:54.208
should do what is right, not what is popular.

123
00:06:54.208 --> 00:06:55.666
Show them

124
00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:58.875
how to remain calm in criticism

125
00:06:58.875 --> 00:07:02.875
and humble in praise.

126
00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:07.916
Build the family on stability,
not on appearances.

127
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:11.375
The world does not only need
impressive people –

128
00:07:11.375 --> 00:07:14.208
it also needs steady people.

129
00:07:14.208 --> 00:07:18.208
And this begins at home.

130
00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:22.333
Not only by correcting, but by

131
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:27.750
sowing the right values through guidance.

132
00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.208
Reflect on this.

133
00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.708
Now think

134
00:07:35.708 --> 00:07:39.125
about your workplace.

135
00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.041
At work,

136
00:07:41.041 --> 00:07:45.791
you often get caught up in others’ opinions.

137
00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:48.416
One moment praise comes

138
00:07:48.416 --> 00:07:52.000
and it feels like everything has been achieved.

139
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.541
The very next moment criticism arrives

140
00:07:55.541 --> 00:08:00.083
and confidence wavers.

141
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:02.708
If your sense of worth

142
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:06.875
keeps rising and falling with every opinion,

143
00:08:06.875 --> 00:08:10.375
how will stability ever come?

144
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:15.000
The Gita reminds you – do not
swell with applause,

145
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.833
do not break under criticism.

146
00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:21.708
Your true contribution is determined

147
00:08:21.708 --> 00:08:25.083
not by praise or complaint,

148
00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:29.125
but by your purpose.

149
00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:31.666
Ask yourself –

150
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:36.166
are you doing your work with sincerity?

151
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:37.083
Are you

152
00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:40.958
showing up with integrity?

153
00:08:40.958 --> 00:08:43.791
This is what matters most.

154
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:47.750
When you are grounded in your purpose,

155
00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:53.166
you no longer need the world’s applause.

156
00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:56.166
And when a mistake happens,

157
00:08:56.166 --> 00:08:58.958
you do not fall apart –

158
00:08:58.958 --> 00:09:02.166
you learn, correct,

159
00:09:02.166 --> 00:09:04.166
and move forward.

160
00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:07.458
So whether there is praise in a meeting

161
00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:11.625
or an uncomfortable reaction – remember,

162
00:09:11.625 --> 00:09:15.750
your goal is not to please everyone.

163
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.625
Your goal is to give your best –

164
00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:23.708
without ego and without fear.

165
00:09:23.708 --> 00:09:24.958
Reflect on this.
